    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to a very special concert.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It all starts with one strange thing:<br>The piano is just\u2026 way too big.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822430/extras/1c4c2616ec61130c657d24342a2fc622.avif?t=1753683629\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Biggest Piano</i> is a short, comedic horror adventure.<br>It's supposed to be scary\u2014but probably isn't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A strange letter arrives at the office of detective Ota.<br>It's from Shoko, a music student and pianist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The location? A concert hall still in operation.<br>Together with his companions Takeru and Makoto, Ota begins investigating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything seems normal. A little too normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then the piano starts to grow.<br>Something appears\u2014drawn to the sound\u2014something that never stops playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s scary but funny.<br>Funny, but kind of scary.<br>But really\u2026 it\u2019s probably not that scary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you break the curse and save Shoko?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your senses are the score. The escape is your finale.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The curtain rises on the most unforgettable concert of the year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822430/extras/9f71373495c2f82a1df341811e11c041.avif?t=1753683629\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fear plays in fortissimo. Will you ever reach the final rest?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Biggest Piano</strong> is a 20-minute horror adventure game that begins with a single, unsettling realization:<br><i>\u201cSomething\u2019s wrong with the piano.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb9 Designed for players who aren\u2019t good with horror\u2014this game is spooky, but not too scary.<br>\ud83d\ude05 No jump scares or gore. Just a mysterious, slightly cursed piano.<br>\ud83d\uddb1 Controls are kept simple for accessibility.<br>\ud83d\udc2d A mouse-only mode is available so you can even move without touching the keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Great as an <strong>introductory horror game</strong> for first-time players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And it's totally free\u2014so give it a try and enjoy the concert! \ud83c\udfb5</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Two big endings!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls: Move with WASD, look with your mouse!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Big laughs and thrills\u2014for free! (It's a birthday gift for the developer\u2019s daughter!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3822430/extras/852b480e831a31204fa8eb97a081ec59.avif?t=1753683629\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Note:</strong><br>This game was developed somewhere between horror and comedy.<br>Occasionally, the piano may grow to a size not intended by the developer.<br>If this occurs, please report the piano size in your review.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streaming &amp; Content Creation:</strong><br>You're welcome to stream or share content from this game!<br>For details and contact info, please see our [official website].</p>",
